{"3079190": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "PACS - Post Apocalypse Courier Service: Co-op Delivery Simulator", "steam_appid": 3079190, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>Sign Up For The Playtest!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079190/extras/5de05c4965d8f736c6c9d139565488d0.avif?t=1786981882\" width=1560 height=484 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Do you have what it takes to grow your Post Apocalypse Courier Service (PACS) from scrappy small-timer to best in the wasteland?</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deliver parcels with up to 4 players for exciting online co-op gameplay, and earn your place in the post-apocalypse</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive through extreme weather and treacherous terrain</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge on foot or wheels to survive and repair your equipment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your vehicles with engines, wheels, batteries, drivetrain, bodywork, and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Package parcels, manage your inventory, and be strategic with transport space and materials</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wear a company issued respirator at all times</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079190/extras/fbbe31f566e5963959d4f9a43ca96e4d.poster.avif?t=1786981882\" width=780 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079190/extras/fbbe31f566e5963959d4f9a43ca96e4d.webm?t=1786981882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079190/extras/0312b818fedbc90a500fc549940af82a.avif?t=1786981882\" width=1560 height=310 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079190/extras/64ac72526ba8273a918c6878a3e63e38.poster.avif?t=1786981882\" width=780 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079190/extras/64ac72526ba8273a918c6878a3e63e38.webm?t=1786981882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>(Surviving in this post apocalypse requires a route and a plan)</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accept delivery orders from the last holdouts of humanity, and customize your vehicle to ensure you and your crew will get there <i>mostly </i>unirradiated. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Package carefully! Cargo can be awkwardly sized, explosive, or even radioactive. We wouldn't want any incidents!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079190/extras/151b85c20efd116e1b9c579bd60133b6.avif?t=1786981882\" width=1560 height=310 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079190/extras/29ed5d0243163df90efe825cffa6a94b.poster.avif?t=1786981882\" width=780 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079190/extras/29ed5d0243163df90efe825cffa6a94b.webm?t=1786981882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>(fulfil the apocalyptic miracle of a package delivered on time)</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cracked roads and overgrown trails dot a treacherous landscape between you and a happy customer. Navigate apocalyptic terrain and weather while keeping packages safe and secure. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive in a convoy with friends, or barrel through the unknown alone—do whatever it takes to deliver, get paid, and survive another day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079190/extras/e0f0d64f402dc9bd277f659f0584df76.avif?t=1786981882\" width=1560 height=310 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079190/extras/0272c9f35f11ee3cf0bfbac8859e08ee.poster.avif?t=1786981882\" width=780 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079190/extras/0272c9f35f11ee3cf0bfbac8859e08ee.webm?t=1786981882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>(postie progression)</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge what’s left of the world on foot or wheels for parts to upgrade your vehicles, increase your delivery capacity, and search for supplies to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and expand your service to new zones with exciting challenges, but don’t forget to slow down and smell the radiation (WARNING: All smelling must be through company issued respirator masks). The varied terrain of the apocalypse can be beautiful, if you catch the smog with friends at the right time.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Do you have what it takes to grow your Post Apocalypse Courier Service (PACS) from scrappy small-timer to best in the wasteland?</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deliver parcels with up to 4 players for exciting online co-op gameplay, and earn your place in the post-apocalypse</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive through extreme weather and treacherous terrain</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge on foot or wheels to survive and repair your equipment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your vehicles with engines, wheels, batteries, drivetrain, bodywork, and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Package parcels, manage your inventory, and be strategic with transport space and materials</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wear a company issued respirator at all times</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079190/extras/fbbe31f566e5963959d4f9a43ca96e4d.poster.avif?t=1786981882\" width=780 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079190/extras/fbbe31f566e5963959d4f9a43ca96e4d.webm?t=1786981882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079190/extras/0312b818fedbc90a500fc549940af82a.avif?t=1786981882\" width=1560 height=310 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079190/extras/64ac72526ba8273a918c6878a3e63e38.poster.avif?t=1786981882\" width=780 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079190/extras/64ac72526ba8273a918c6878a3e63e38.webm?t=1786981882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>(Surviving in this post apocalypse requires a route and a plan)</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accept delivery orders from the last holdouts of humanity, and customize your vehicle to ensure you and your crew will get there <i>mostly </i>unirradiated. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Package carefully! Cargo can be awkwardly sized, explosive, or even radioactive. We wouldn't want any incidents!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079190/extras/151b85c20efd116e1b9c579bd60133b6.avif?t=1786981882\" width=1560 height=310 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079190/extras/29ed5d0243163df90efe825cffa6a94b.poster.avif?t=1786981882\" width=780 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079190/extras/29ed5d0243163df90efe825cffa6a94b.webm?t=1786981882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>(fulfil the apocalyptic miracle of a package delivered on time)</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cracked roads and overgrown trails dot a treacherous landscape between you and a happy customer. Navigate apocalyptic terrain and weather while keeping packages safe and secure. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive in a convoy with friends, or barrel through the unknown alone—do whatever it takes to deliver, get paid, and survive another day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079190/extras/e0f0d64f402dc9bd277f659f0584df76.avif?t=1786981882\" width=1560 height=310 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079190/extras/0272c9f35f11ee3cf0bfbac8859e08ee.poster.avif?t=1786981882\" width=780 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079190/extras/0272c9f35f11ee3cf0bfbac8859e08ee.webm?t=1786981882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>(postie progression)</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge what’s left of the world on foot or wheels for parts to upgrade your vehicles, increase your delivery capacity, and search for supplies to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and expand your service to new zones with exciting challenges, but don’t forget to slow down and smell the radiation (WARNING: All smelling must be through company issued respirator masks). The varied terrain of the apocalypse can be beautiful, if you catch the smog with friends at the right time.</p>", "short_description": "It’s the postiepocalypse! Grab up to 3 friends, navigate treacherous environments, scavenge for vehicle upgrades, and grow a courier service that fulfills the apocalyptic miracle of a package delivered on time.", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Polish, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Turkish", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079190/d70472700ba2c1e6bcd6f54697581f15657ee49b/header.jpg?t=1786981882", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079190/057ad74d124bf5b3deebf83dc0efa7fea70a170e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786981882", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079190/057ad74d124bf5b3deebf83dc0efa7fea70a170e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786981882", "website": "https://www.pacsgame.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 64bit OS<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5-3570K 3.4 GHz 4 Core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 970 4GB / AMD RX 580 4GB<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 15 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "legal_notice": "Studio 316 © and Playstack Ltd 2025 - All Rights Reserved", "developers": ["Studio 316"], "publishers": ["Playstack"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 1, "description": "Multi-player"}, {"id": 9, "description": "Co-op"}, {"id": 38, "description": "Online Co-op"}, {"id": 28, "description": "Full controller support"}, {"id": 55, "description": "DualShock Controller Support"}, {"id": 57, "description": "DualSense Controller Support"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "25", "description": "Adventure"}, {"id": "23", "description": "Indie"}, {"id": "28", "